# =============================================================================
# OmniMesh — ONE local backup file (save OUTSIDE this repo)
# =============================================================================
#
# 1. Fill this file once with real values.
# 2. Save a copy somewhere safe OFF your laptop, e.g.:
#      Google Drive / iCloud / USB  →  OmniMesh-secrets.properties
# 3. Never commit the filled file (secrets.properties is gitignored).
#
# --- After you clone github.com/Adya6714/OmniMesh on a new machine -----------
#
#   git clone git@github.com:Adya6714/OmniMesh.git && cd OmniMesh
#   cp ~/Drive/OmniMesh-secrets.properties ./secrets.properties
#   gh auth login
#   ./scripts/sync-github-actions-secrets.sh    # pushes secrets to GitHub
#   make setup
#
# GitHub Actions secrets stay on GitHub until you delete the repo.
# Re-run sync only if you created a new empty repo or secrets were wiped.
#
# =============================================================================

